<p>It is also possible to define the target on a per-message basis.
The publisher must be defined without any target and each message define its target in the <code>to</code> field of the properties section.
Libraries provide helpers in the message creation API to define the message target, which avoids dealing with the  <a class="" href=/docs/amqp#address-v2>address format</a>.</p>
