<p>An application can still close a consumer without pausing it, at the risk of processing the same messages several times.</p>
<h4 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id=support-for-streams-1>Support for Streams<a href=#support-for-streams-1 class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Support for Streams" title="Direct link to Support for Streams" translate=no>​</a></h4>
