<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id=lifecycle-listeners>Lifecycle Listeners<a href=#lifecycle-listeners class=hash-link aria-label="Direct link to Lifecycle Listeners" title="Direct link to Lifecycle Listeners" translate=no>​</a></h3>
<p>Applications can react to state changes of some API components by adding listeners.
An application can add a listener to a connection to stop publishing messages when the connection is recovering after a connection.
The application can then resume publishing when the connection has recovered and is open again.</p>
